    <!-- Terms & Conditions Section Start -->
    <section class="service-details-section fix section-padding">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-12">
                    <div class="service-details-wrapper">
                        <div class="service-details-content">
                            <p class="mb-3"><strong>Last updated:</strong> November 2025</p>
                            <p class="mb-4">Welcome to KLASSICKAPITAL. By accessing or purchasing from this website, you
                                agree to the following terms and conditions. Please read them carefully.</p>

                            <h3 class="mt-5 mb-3">1. Definitions</h3>
                            <ul class="list-items mb-4">
                                <li><strong>"We", "Us", "Our"</strong> refer to KLASSICKAPITAL.</li>
                                <li><strong>"You", "User", "Client"</strong> refer to anyone accessing or purchasing
                                    from this website.</li>
                                <li><strong>"System"</strong> refers to the KLASSICKAPITAL SYSTEM trading tool.</li>
                            </ul>

                            <h3 class="mt-5 mb-3">2. Use of the System</h3>
                            <p class="mb-3">KLASSICKAPITAL SYSTEM is a trading tool designed to assist with analysis and
                                automation on TradingView. It does not guarantee profits, and all trading decisions
                                remain your responsibility.</p>
                            <p class="mb-2"><strong>You agree not to:</strong></p>
                            <ul class="list-items mb-4">
                                <li>Resell or distribute the system without permission</li>
                                <li>Share access keys or files</li>
                                <li>Reverse-engineer or modify the system</li>
                            </ul>

                            <h3 class="mt-5 mb-3">3. Payment & Access</h3>
                            <ul class="list-items mb-4">
                                <li>The system is sold for a <strong>one-time fee of $300</strong>.</li>
                                <li>Access is delivered after payment confirmation.</li>
                                <li><strong>All sales are final</strong> due to the digital nature of the product.</li>
                            </ul>

                            <h3 class="mt-5 mb-3">4. Referral Program</h3>
                            <ul class="list-items mb-4">
                                <li>You earn <strong>$20 for every successful referral</strong>.</li>
                                <li>Payouts are processed after the referred user completes payment.</li>
                                <li>Fraudulent referrals will result in removal from the program.</li>
                            </ul>

                            <h3 class="mt-5 mb-3">5. No Financial Advice</h3>
                            <p class="mb-4">KLASSICKAPITAL does not provide financial, investment, or trading advice.
                                All trading involves risk. You are responsible for your own decisions.</p>

                            <h3 class="mt-5 mb-3">6. Support</h3>
                            <ul class="list-items mb-4">
                                <li>We provide setup and technical support via WhatsApp, Telegram, and email.</li>
                                <li>Support does not include personal mentorship or financial coaching.</li>
                            </ul>

                            <h3 class="mt-5 mb-3">7. Limitation of Liability</h3>
                            <p class="mb-2">KLASSICKAPITAL is not responsible for:</p>
                            <ul class="list-items mb-4">
                                <li>Trading losses</li>
                                <li>Platform outages (e.g., TradingView)</li>
                                <li>Internet or device issues</li>
                                <li>Misuse of the system</li>
                            </ul>

                            <h3 class="mt-5 mb-3">8. Privacy</h3>
                            <p class="mb-4">We respect your privacy. Any personal information you provide is used only
                                for communication and support. (Your full Privacy Policy will be on a separate page.)
                            </p>

                            <h3 class="mt-5 mb-3">9. Changes to Terms</h3>
                            <p class="mb-4">We may update these terms at any time. Continued use of the system means you
                                accept the updated terms.</p>

                            <h3 class="mt-5 mb-3">10. Contact</h3>
                            <p class="mb-2">For questions about these terms:</p>
                            <ul class="list-items mb-4">
                                <li><a href="mailto:support@klassickapital.com">support@klassickapital.com</a></li>
                                <li><a href="tel:+2347032285613">+234 703 228 5613</a></li>
                            </ul>

                            <div class="mt-5 pt-4 text-center">
                                <a href="checkout.html" class="theme-btn">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-cart-shopping me-2"></i>
                                    Proceed to Checkout
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

